    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka\u2019s first automated book vending machine launched\n\nThe Book Studio Pvt Ltd has introduced Sri Lanka\u2019s first fully automated book vending machine, a pioneering move that blends technology with reading access.\n\nThe self-service unit allows readers to instantly purchase books at high-traffic locations, transforming how literature is discovered and bought. The initiative aligns with the company\u2019s belief that \u201ceverywhere can be a reading space,\u201d targeting busy modern lifestyles.\n\nMr. Kushan Gunasekera, CEO & Director of The Book Studio, called the launch a milestone in the company\u2019s journey toward a more well-read Sri Lanka. \u201cBy leveraging automated technology, we are making the act of discovering a new book as seamless and effortless as possible,\u201d he said.\n\nTwo new flagship outlets are set to open in the Southern and Northern regions with contemporary design and immersive customer experiences.\n\nCeylinco Life donates medical gas system to teaching hospital Kalutara\n\nFuel shortages hit premium petrol, diesel as dealers cite low margins\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
